Rerun in this workspace: python3 source_audit.py; python3 build_and_check.py. No installations, network fetches, workers, other-model calls, heavy computation or external messages were used. These are unverified drafts: hashes, execution and compilation establish artifact identity/execution, not mathematical correctness. The partial theorem in n2 does not close the original nontrivial positive-residue-characteristic atom, so candidate=false.
